OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed after causing crash
OL,4,Athat killed his wife
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose wife died three years after
OL,7,Fsustaining injuries in a crash he
OL,8,Fcaused has been jailed.
OL,10,FSylwia Borychowska was a front-seat
OL,11,Fpassenger in a vehicle being driven by
OL,12,FHaseeb Ahmed, when it left a 20mph
OL,13,F(32km/h) road and hit a tree in
OL,14,FMapperley Road, Nottingham, on 3 August
OL,15,F2019.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
