OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed after causing crash
OL,4,Athat killed his wife
OL,5,
OL,6,FBorychowska, 25, sustained injuries and
OL,7,Funderwent surgery to remove a section
OL,8,Fof her bowel, spending two months in
OL,9,Fhospital. The surgery left her
OL,10,Fvulnerable to infection and in 2022,
OL,11,Fshe contracted pneumonia and died on 27
OL,12,FOctober of that year. A post-mortem
OL,13,Fexamination concluded the crash
OL,14,Finjuries led to her death.
OL,16,FAhmed, 34, was jailed for three years
OL,17,Fat Nottingham Crown Court on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
